<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Products — Empty State</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@600;650;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* CSS Reset & Base Rules */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      color: #202020;
      font-family: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Typography tokens */
    h1, .h1 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 650;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: #202020;
    }

    h2, .h2 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 650;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: #202020;
    }

    h3, .h3 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    .quiet {
      color: #626262;
    }

    /* Semantic status tokens */
    .status-good {
      color: #24704B;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .status-good::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #24704B;
    }

    .status-waiting {
      color: #805800;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .status-waiting::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #805800;
    }

    .status-refused {
      color: #AE2C2C;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .status-refused::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #AE2C2C;
    }

    /* Keyframes and Transitions */
    @keyframes pageEntrance {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(4px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes savedHandoff {
      from {
        opacity: 0.6;
        transform: translateY(8px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes waitingBreathe {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    .page-container {
      animation: pageEntrance 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    /* Global Header */
    header.site-header {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      height: 56px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 32px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .header-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      background-color: #202020;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #202020;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    nav.main-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      height: 56px;
    }

    .nav-link {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #202020;
      text-decoration: none;
      height: 56px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 150ms ease;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: #A94B1D;
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      color: #A94B1D;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-link.active::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: #A94B1D;
    }

    .nav-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: -2px;
    }

    .header-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .user-profile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .avatar-initials {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #202020;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    .lang-switcher {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
      border-left: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    /* Main Layout */
    main.content-area {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 32px 64px 32px;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* Search & Filter Panel */
    .filter-panel {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .field-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .field-group.flex-1 {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .field-group.w-200 {
      width: 220px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .input-field, .select-field {
      height: 48px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #202020;
      width: 100%;
      transition: border-color 150ms ease;
    }

    .input-field::placeholder {
      color: #626262;
    }

    .input-field:focus, .select-field:focus {
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: -1px;
      border-color: #A94B1D;
    }

    .select-field {
      appearance: none;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23202020' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'%3e%3cpolyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'%3e%3c/polyline%3e%3c/svg%3e");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: right 14px center;
      background-size: 16px;
      padding-right: 40px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 2px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 120ms ease, border-color 120ms ease, transform 90ms ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.99);
    }

    .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #A94B1D;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #A94B1D;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #933f17;
      border-color: #933f17;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      color: #202020;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      border-color: #B5B5B5;
    }

    /* Empty State Panel */
    .table-container {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .table-header-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 100px 2.2fr 1.2fr 1.2fr 1.2fr 120px;
      height: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 16px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #626262;
    }

    .empty-state-card {
      padding: 80px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .empty-state-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      color: #626262;
    }

    .empty-state-title {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #202020;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .empty-state-description {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #626262;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Inline Add Product Form Section */
    .inline-form-panel {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .inline-form-header {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .form-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 16px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }

    .field-hint {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #626262;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Prefers reduced motion */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .page-container, .btn, .nav-link, .input-field, .select-field {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Header: exact specification -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <a href="#" class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">M</div>
        <span class="brand-name">Meridian</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="#" class="nav-link active">Products</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Organisations</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Accounts</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Audit trail</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Reports</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <div class="user-profile">
        <div class="avatar-initials">MV</div>
        <span>Marcus Vale · System Administrator</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lang-switcher">
        <span>EN / العربية</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Area -->
  <main class="content-area page-container">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Products</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Search, Filter & CSV Export Panel -->
    <section class="filter-panel">
      <div class="field-group flex-1">
        <label for="product-search">Search products</label>
        <input 
          type="text" 
          id="product-search" 
          class="input-field" 
          placeholder="Filter by product name, specification or profile..."
        />
      </div>

      <div class="field-group w-200">
        <label for="status-filter">Status</label>
        <select id="status-filter" class="select-field">
          <option value="all">All statuses</option>
          <option value="active">Active</option>
          <option value="inactive">Inactive</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#202020" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
          <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
          <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
        </svg>
        CSV export
      </button>
    </section>

    <!-- Empty State Dense Table Skeleton & Message -->
    <section class="table-container">
      <div class="table-header-row">
        <div>Photo</div>
        <div>Product name</div>
        <div>Pack size</div>
        <div>Thermal profile</div>
        <div>Status</div>
        <div>Action</div>
      </div>

      <div class="empty-state-card">
        <div class="empty-state-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#626262" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="empty-state-title">No products recorded</h2>
        <p class="empty-state-description">
          No pharmaceutical cold-chain products have been registered for distribution yet. Complete the inline form below to register your first product.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Primary Add Product inline form state -->
    <section class="inline-form-panel">
      <div class="inline-form-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Add product</h2>
          <p class="quiet" style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 4px;">Configure a validated cold-chain medicinal product and assign its baseline thermal parameters.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-waiting">waiting submission</span>
      </div>

      <form action="#" method="post" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field-group">
            <label for="prod-name">Product trade name</label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="prod-name" 
              class="input-field" 
              placeholder="e.g. Insulin Glargine 100 units/mL"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="field-group">
            <label for="prod-pack">Pack size & configuration</label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="prod-pack" 
              class="input-field" 
              placeholder="e.g. pack of 10 pens"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="field-group">
            <label for="prod-profile">Effective thermal profile</label>
            <select id="prod-profile" class="select-field">
              <option value="v3">Profile v3 (Permitted 2.0°C–8.0°C, upper tier >8–10°C, 30m allowance)</option>
              <option value="v4">Profile v4 (Proposed future release)</option>
            </select>
            <span class="field-hint">Profile v3 is the current read-only active release standard.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="field-group">
            <label for="prod-status">Initial product status</label>
            <select id="prod-status" class="select-field">
              <option value="active">Active (available for intake & allocation)</option>
              <option value="inactive">Inactive</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="reset" class="btn btn-secondary">Clear fields</button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Add product</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
